From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] background: Video thumbnails through GStreamer

The video section of the Background page showed an icon and the name
for every video but GIFs. cc-plinius-panorama.c now takes one frame of
each video through playbin (on the phone plinius-vdec, as
plinius-ambient plays it) and keeps the thumbnail in the cache; for
that the panel links GStreamer.

---
diff --git a/panels/background/meson.build b/panels/background/meson.build
--- a/panels/background/meson.build
+++ b/panels/background/meson.build
@@ -81,6 +81,7 @@
   gnome_bg_dep,
   libxml_dep,
   dependency('cairo-gobject'),
+  dependency('gstreamer-1.0'),
 ]
 
 cflags += [
-- 
2.55.0
